\caption{RMSE relative to uniform sampling (below 1 is better) against the number of items $n$, one panel per target split; log-log axes. Lines: geometric mean over non-thin benchmarks (13; 12 for lineage); bands: 95\% family-bootstrap interval. One representative per method class plus the three best methods by the primary endpoint (chosen after the results).}
